{
  "name": "AI Desktop Assistant",
  "description": "Altron is an autonomous Windows desktop assistant: a headless Python orchestrator that drives a local Flask HUD in the browser, always-on voice control (wake word, faster-whisper STT, TTS), permission-gated desktop and file automation tools, and Telegram remote control with out-of-band approvals, backed by the Anthropic Claude Messages API.",
